---
title: "The state of a new Swipe"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: At rest
    lg1: Writing
    lg2: Unread
    lg3: Breaks ANewTextIsShownWithACheckedState
    lg4: Path to the ANewTextIsShownWithACheckedState bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Idle, the text keeps its start state
  s1: The narrator writes the retry
  s2: The narrator writes
  s3: The text shows, its state is not read yet
  s4: The rules read the new text
  s5: Idle, the text keeps a state the rules never read
  s6: Idle, the text is read
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you retry a typed input
  s0 --> s2: you send an action
  s1 --> s0: the server restarts or you press Stop or the retry's text is saved and keeps the start state
  s2 --> s3: the text is saved with the pre-analysis state
  s2 --> s0: the server restarts or you press Stop
  s3 --> s4: the rules read the new text
  s3 --> s5: the server restarts or you press Stop
  s4 --> s6: the Job ends or the server restarts or you press Stop
  s5 --> s1: you retry a typed input
  s5 --> s2: you send an action
  s6 --> s1: you retry a typed input
  s6 --> s2: you send an action
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 orange
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 blue
  class s5 orange
  class s5 breaks
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
